@gpuixui/motion
===============

This package is a TypeScript port. No Rust source is vendored and no crate is
imported as a dependency; the maths and API shapes below travel under the
notices their upstream projects require.

open-gpui — crates/motion
-------------------------

https://github.com/Latias94/open-gpui

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The closed-form spring, timeline,
sequence and reduced-motion policy maths are translated to TypeScript; the
caller owns the clock and `Duration` becomes a number in milliseconds.

